    },
    {
      "text": "Total Interest Financial Year to Date: $123.45",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 397,
      "x2": 268,
      "y2": 386,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 397
    },
    {
      "text": "Total Interest for this statement: $123.45",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 411,
      "x2": 249,
      "y2": 400,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 411
    },
    {
      "text": "Tax File Number / Exemption Provided: Yes",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 425,
      "x2": 255,
      "y2": 414,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 425
    },
    {
      "text": "Please check all transactions carefully. If you believe there is an error or unauthorised transaction, or if you have",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 448,
      "x2": 541,
      "y2": 438,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 448
    },
    {
      "text": "any queries, please call us as soon as possible on 133 464.",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 459,
      "x2": 299,
      "y2": 449,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 459
    },
    {
      "text": "For the curious:",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 479,
      "x2": 89,
      "y2": 471,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 479
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping you safe and secure",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 494,
      "x2": 131,
      "y2": 486,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 494
    },
    {
      "text": "ING takes the security of customers' accounts, transactions and information very seriously. It's also important for you to take all reasonable precautions to ensure that",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 508,
      "x2": 541,
      "y2": 500,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 508
    },
    {
      "text": "your codes and devices for your account are not misused and remain secure and confidential. Please remember these security guidelines:",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 518,
      "x2": 458,
      "y2": 510,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 518
    },
    {
      "text": "1.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 534,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 526,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 534
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't share your Codes (Access Code, PIN, any passcode you use to authenticate a transaction on your account and any additional security code we",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 534,
      "x2": 516,
      "y2": 526,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 534
    },
    {
      "text": "provide you to conduct certain transactions - including one time passwords provided by SMS) with anyone. In some specific circumstances when speaking",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 544,
      "x2": 532,
      "y2": 536,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 544
    },
    {
      "text": "with one of our Customer Care Specialists we may request a one-time password (as reflected in your Terms and Conditions booklet).",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 555,
      "x2": 466,
      "y2": 547,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 555
    },
    {
      "text": "2.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 571,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 563,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 571
    },
    {
      "text": "Where you choose a Code make sure that it is difficult to guess. It should not be associated with your date of birth, Client Number, or name, or consist of",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 571,
      "x2": 522,
      "y2": 563,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 571
    },
    {
      "text": "repeated, ascending or descending characters.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 582,
      "x2": 210,
      "y2": 574,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 582
    },
    {
      "text": "3.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 598,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 590,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 598
    },
    {
      "text": "If you have a Visa card on your account, don't give it to anyone else or let anyone else use it. If you have a virtual Visa card installed on a device, do not",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 598,
      "x2": 522,
      "y2": 590,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 598
    },
    {
      "text": "install another person's biometric identifiers on that device or share your device access code.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 608,
      "x2": 346,
      "y2": 600,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 608
    },
    {
      "text": "4.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 625,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 617,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 625
    },
    {
      "text": "Avoid using computers that are shared with other unknown people for online banking, such as internet cafes and libraries.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 625,
      "x2": 435,
      "y2": 617,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 625
    },
    {
      "text": "5.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 641,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 633,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 641
    },
    {
      "text": "If you record your Code, store it in a safe place that is password protected, separate from your Client Number or any device you use to transact on the",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 641,
      "x2": 516,
      "y2": 633,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 641
    },
    {
      "text": "account.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 652,
      "x2": 93,
      "y2": 644,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 652
    },
    {
      "text": "6.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 668,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 660,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 668
    },
    {
      "text": "Use care to prevent anyone else seeing your Codes or PIN when being entered.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 668,
      "x2": 305,
      "y2": 660,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 668
    },
    {
      "text": "7.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 684,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 676,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 684
    },
    {
      "text": "ING will never send you an email asking you to click on a link to access online banking, or to provide your Access Code, Security Code or PIN.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 684,
      "x2": 486,
      "y2": 676,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 684
    },
    {
      "text": "8.",
      "x1": 52,
      "y1": 701,
      "x2": 58,
      "y2": 693,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 701
    },
    {
      "text": "Please check all transactions carefully. If you think or suspect that there's been an error or unauthorised transaction, that anyone else knows any of your",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 701,
      "x2": 529,
      "y2": 693,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 701
    },
    {
      "text": "Codes, or that any of your devices have been lost, stolen, or used without your permission, call us straight away on 133 464. If you don't notify us",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 711,
      "x2": 505,
      "y2": 703,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 711
    },
    {
      "text": "immediately when you realise or suspect anyone else knows your Codes you may be liable for any transactions that occur on your account.",
      "x1": 66,
      "y1": 722,
      "x2": 492,
      "y2": 714,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 722
    },
    {
      "text": "We can cancel any access method associated with a Code at any time without notice if we believe it is being used in a way that can cause loss to you or us, and you may",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 738,
      "x2": 548,
      "y2": 730,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 738
    },
    {
      "text": "be liable for transactions on your account. You may also be liable for transactions where you or another user engage in fraud, voluntarily disclose Codes, or act with",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 748,
      "x2": 534,
      "y2": 740,
      "page": 1,
      "y1_bin": 748
    },
    {
      "text": "extreme carelessness. These guidelines do not set out all the circumstances in which you may be liable for unauthorised electronic transactions. Your liability for",
      "x1": 38,
      "y1": 757,
